@WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5076

### Alle Todos
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/todos
Accept: application/json

### Todo anlegen
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Einkaufen gehen"
}

### Einzelnes Todo
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/todos/1

### Todo aktualisieren
PUT {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Einkaufen gehen",
  "isDone": true
}

### Todo löschen
DELETE {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/todos/1
